<title>UK: Flare Group leaps after full-year figures.</title>
<headline>Flare Group leaps after full-year figures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Flare Group Plc gained on Wednesday, after the industrial ceramics supplier reported better-than-expected full year figures, dealers said.</p>
<p>Flare Group shares were up 11p at 140-1/2p by 1130 GMT.</p>
<p>Pre-tax profits leapt to 3.3 million stg from an adjusted 800,000 stg for the pevious year.</p>
<p>&quot;These are good figures. We have since seen a few buyers of the stock,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>The company said it hoped to expand further in 1997 through strategic acquisitions and organic growth.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
